 "lines": [
  {
   "layout": "title",
   "en": "4 a.m. — the city died"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "only you were smiling"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "slipping past the convenience store lights"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "down a road whose name we don't even know"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "“how far are we going?”"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "we promised never to ask"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "yesterday, tossed onto the passenger seat"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "and a half-drunk, lukewarm coffee"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "the right way to live"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I want to forget it, just for tonight"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "an unfamiliar song on the radio"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "you hum along under your breath"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "watching your profile"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I feel like I could never go home"
  },
  {
   "layout": "title",
   "en": "a getaway at 4 a.m."
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "take me away until the morning comes"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "even if our tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "is nowhere to be found, that's alright"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "flowing past beyond the window"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "afterimages of a sleepless city"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "with you, even a place with nothing"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "felt like the edge of the world"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "a rusted guardrail along the sea"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "the wind was strangely cold"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "you, still barefoot,"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "were gazing at the white waves"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "“will we forget all of this someday?”"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "you murmured, almost to yourself"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "there were things I wanted to forget"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "but this was a night I never wanted to"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "come tomorrow, surely"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "we'll go back to our everyday faces"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "so just for now"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "let's stay liars a little longer"
  },
  {
   "layout": "title",
   "en": "a getaway at 4 a.m."
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I was afraid of the morning coming"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "we couldn't give our yesterday"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "a name"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "the horizon turns pale"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "light fills your eyes"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "pretending to look for the way home"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "we stayed here a little longer"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "the truth is, I wanted to run"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "not from you, but from myself"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "but next to you"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I could breathe, just a little"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "instead of asking “will I see you again?”"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I started the engine"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "you smiled, a little troubled"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "“let's meet in the daytime next time”"
  },
  {
   "layout": "title",
   "en": "a getaway at 4 a.m."
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "the sunrise dyes the city"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "our tomorrow is beginning"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "or so it felt"
  },
  {
   "layout": "low",
   "en": "flowing past beyond the window"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "the shadow of who I was until yesterday"
  },
  {
   "layout": "high",
   "en": "that horizon we saw together"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "I'll live on without forgetting it"
  },
  {
   "layout": "title",
   "en": "4 a.m. — the city woke up"
  },
  {
   "layout": "vleft",
   "en": "only you were still smiling",
   "hold": 2.5
  }
 ],
